growerp.landing.PageSection.contentJson:
[
          {"tag":"Chapter 1","title":"The Small Business Bottleneck","description":"The 'Silo Effect' keeps financial, sales and supply chain data trapped in departmental islands. A symptom-to-solution framework shows what each kind of manual chaos actually costs you.","points":["Spreadsheet chaos: stale supplier lists, duplicates, undocumented tribal knowledge","Reporting lags: why closing the books still takes days or weeks","Manual intervention costs: re-keying data between disconnected systems","What an integrated system of record replaces each of them with"],"footer":"Recognise the cost"},
          {"tag":"Chapter 2","title":"Simple Cloud ERP vs Enterprise Complexity","description":"A side-by-side comparison of the on-premise model and a cloud ERP, scored on the four things that decide whether a small business can actually carry the system.","points":["Upfront capital against a predictable monthly subscription","In-house IT staff against consumer-grade UX and high adoption","Disruptive manual upgrades against automatic updates","Local server footprint against zero hardware requirements"],"footer":"Choose the right scale"}
        ]

[
          {"tag":"Chapter 4","title":"Data Migration and the 'Clean Core' Strategy","description":"Migration is the most common failure point, and it is rarely the software's fault. Five checks keep your new system standard, scalable and cheap to update.","points":["Audit historical data and weed out obsolete suppliers and closed accounts","Cleanse duplicates so your single source of truth is actually true","Define scope: which open transactions move, what stays archived","Map legacy fields to GrowERP CSV formats and test-load a sample batch"],"footer":"Avoid the pitfalls"},
          {"tag":"Chapter 5","title":"GrowERP Quick-Start: Setup to First Workflow","description":"Three sequences that take you from an empty system to a live, automated transaction in record time.","points":["Company profile and operational controls: tax IDs, currency, PO numbering","Categories and catalog imported in the GrowERP CSV format","Ledger automation: one purchase-to-pay transaction, invoice received to paid","A 30-day post-launch review to fix the friction points you find"],"footer":"Get operational"}
        ]
